      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "DYNAMIC BELLA (8) was quickly into stride on debut to score by one length (20.61) at this track over 365m. Drawn wide but has good early pace. Will break from the same draw this time. Harder here but looks a top chance again. COLONEL ASHBY (7) was crowded for room and fell here last time. Has the ability and can atone with the right run. UNDERCOVER BEAR (3) continues to race well but is struggling to break through, placing at his last five runs. Last time finished 2nd over 365m at this track beaten 4 lengths (20.90) behind Holiday Fund in a Grade 5 on September 16. Has never been out of the placings from two starts out of this box. Will give a great sight again. BANDIT LAURA (6) has ability and finds the right scenario to bounce back.",
